BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston
 .com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/6th-Annual-Miller-Summer-Mixtape-at-Miller
 -Outdoor-Theatre.jpeg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2026/07/6th-Annual-Miller-Summer-Mixtape-at-Miller-Outdoor-Theatre.jpeg
UID:K0_hPwB5YKf4a_K7F9GWx
SUMMARY:6th Annual Miller Summer Mixtape at Miller Outdoor Theatre
DTSTAMP:20260811T040702Z
DTSTART:20260815T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Miller Outdoor Theatre presents the sixth annual Miller Summer 
	Mixtape\, a showcase of how HTX is anything but a single genre\, hosted by
	 Houston music icon Kam Franklin. \nFor 2026\, the lineup highlights Houst
	on’s unique rich musical tapestry\, from the soulful storytelling of Sara 
	Van Buskirk\, to the blues-infused rock of Saint Judas and The Black Hymns
	\, to the powerhouse vocals of Rodell Duff. \nDJ Mikey Drag will also spin
	 a genre-spanning mix of country classics\, twangy favorites\, and a littl
	e cumbia fuego. \nFinding Your Seat at Miller Outdoor Theatre\nAs always\,
	 all seats at Miller are free\, but covered seating for popular evening sh
	ows usually requires a free assigned ticket reserved 24 hours in advance. 
	\nLearn more about getting free seated tickets at Miller. \nAdmission\nFre
	e. Learn more or reserve a free seated ticket. \n \nThis Featured Calendar
